                                                "sense_id": "a573d09f-cba8-347c-95b9-572fa4bb3d7b",
                                                "text": "'Pray, Mistress Mouse, will you give us some beer?\nHeigho, says Rowley,\nFor Froggy and I are fond of good cheer.'"
                                            },
