                                                "sense_id": "93f6610e-3b66-3ef2-ac92-8de76e640668",
                                                "text": "Absolutely voiceless and baggy-eyed from hours of sour singing, no sleep, and a froggy throat from yelling in ego to be heard atop the rest."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5aed4723-56be-3a80-b2db-eec8a0d01e0f",
